<title>USA: Hechinger in talks over possible $3 a share offer.</title>
<headline>Hechinger in talks over possible $3 a share offer.</headline>
<dateline>LARGO, Md. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hechinger Co  said Tuesday it is in talks that may result in a deal in which holder's of the company's outstanding class A and class B common shares would receive $3.00 per share in cash.</p>
<p>&quot;Discussions are ongoing, but no assurance can be made that this or any other transaction will be consummated or, if consummated, the price at which such transaction would be completed,&quot; the home improvement company said.  </p>
<p>Hechinger, which opertes 117 stores in 21 states and the District of Columbia, did not elaborate.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to comment.</p>
